00:09:24.520 --> 00:09:28.620
Wade: Yew think Ah can't but-- Ah would ask you-- tuh lemme try

00:09:28.620 --> 00:09:29.460
Mark: *wheezy laugh*

00:09:29.520 --> 00:09:30.860
Mark: Carrlll! *laughter*

00:09:30.860 --> 00:09:31.880
Wade: Fer Carrrrl!

00:09:31.880 --> 00:09:33.500
Mark: Caaarrrrl! *more laughter*

00:09:33.500 --> 00:09:37.660
Mark: Man, if nobody remembers that... I don't blame you...

00:09:37.660 --> 00:09:39.660
Mark: Man, it--it wasn't worth remembering

00:09:39.660 --> 00:09:40.570
Wade: *unintelligible* --be in here

00:09:40.570 --> 00:09:43.570
Mark: Yeah... and it's absolute- this is dick.

00:09:43.570 --> 00:09:48.670
Wade: Yeah. Well, I don't know what the point of
that was. Why have this entire cave

00:09:48.670 --> 00:09:50.110
system but nothing in it?

00:09:50.110 --> 00:09:51.990
Mark: I don't know, it's really bizarre...

00:09:51.990 --> 00:09:54.630
Mark: *laughs* Well, why have a lot of things
in this game but nothing in it?

00:09:54.840 --> 00:09:55.620
Wade: That's true.

00:09:55.640 --> 00:09:57.120
Mark: Very good questions...

00:09:57.120 --> 00:09:59.000
Wade: I'm gonna kee-- ooh, that looks like thorns...

00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:00.400
Wade: I'm gonna keep looking for a house.

00:10:00.400 --> 00:10:02.180
Wade: There's got to be that house around here...

00:10:02.180 --> 00:10:04.180
Mark: Yeah... Well, what was in the house?

00:10:04.360 --> 00:10:05.300
Mark: Jumpscares?

00:10:05.300 --> 00:10:06.600
Wade: I think there's more ammo.

00:10:06.600 --> 00:10:08.900
Mark: Oh... Well, we don't really need it.

00:10:09.420 --> 00:10:11.680
Mark: I mean, have you ever managed to 
actually kill the rake?

00:10:11.680 --> 00:10:12.520
Wade: Yes.

00:10:12.520 --> 00:10:13.860
Mark: Oh, okay...

00:10:14.460 --> 00:10:15.180
Wade: By...

00:10:15.480 --> 00:10:16.680
Wade: cheating it...

00:10:16.680 --> 00:10:20.160
Mark: That's okay. I'm alright with cheating. Trust me.

00:10:20.170 --> 00:10:23.200
Wade: In fact, the last time-- if I remember
right-- we had a dance party with it.

00:10:23.200 --> 00:10:24.300
Mark: Nice!

00:10:24.300 --> 00:10:25.800
Mark: That sounds great! 
Wade: It was very lovely.

00:10:25.800 --> 00:10:26.760
Wade: It was very lovely.

00:10:26.760 --> 00:10:27.640
Mark: Mmmm.

00:10:28.160 --> 00:10:31.080
Mark: Is there anything on the map in the van
that shows where a house might be?

00:10:31.240 --> 00:10:32.140
Wade: Maybe.

00:10:32.140 --> 00:10:33.830
Wade: *scaredy laughter* If we can find our way back.

00:10:33.830 --> 00:10:35.570
Mark: I don't think we can. I think we're
screwed.

00:10:35.570 --> 00:10:37.160
Mark: Why haven't I seen any piggies? :c

00:10:37.160 --> 00:10:39.800
Mark: I used to see lots and lots of piggies
when I was playing before...

00:10:39.800 --> 00:10:41.960
Wade: They are a bit rarer now... oh there's something--

00:10:41.960 --> 00:10:43.780
Wade: Wait, this is the same waterfall?

00:10:43.780 --> 00:10:45.380
Mark: No way.

00:10:46.060 --> 00:10:48.100
Mark: No, this is different.

00:10:48.620 --> 00:10:50.620
Mark:  Yeah, this has got a bigger leading up to it.

00:10:50.720 --> 00:10:51.500
Wade: Okay.

00:10:51.500 --> 00:10:52.480
Mark: Well, that's weird.

00:10:52.480 --> 00:10:53.740
Wade: Anything around?

00:10:54.080 --> 00:10:55.300
Wade: Anything in this one?

00:10:55.300 --> 00:10:56.700
Mark: There's another thing behind it.

00:10:56.700 --> 00:10:59.870
Mark: It looks like shotgun ammo or sniper ammo?

00:11:01.000 --> 00:11:01.740
Mark: Shotgun?

00:11:01.740 --> 00:11:03.320
Wade: It looks like shotgun. 
Mark: I can't click on it.

00:11:03.320 --> 00:11:04.960
Mark: It's not clickable.

00:11:04.960 --> 00:11:05.930
Wade: Well that's helpful.

00:11:05.930 --> 00:11:10.610
Wade: There's been a shortage, I feel, like of
quality horror games and there's not been a

00:11:10.610 --> 00:11:13.150
Wade: whole lot of creepy pasta related games
in awhile that I've found so...

00:11:13.150 --> 00:11:16.220
Mark: There hasn't been a lot of new creepypasta in forever.

00:11:16.220 --> 00:11:19.070
Wade: Oh that's true... there's not-- there's not been much love given to The Rake though, this is the

00:11:19.070 --> 00:11:20.810
Wade: only game i really know of about it.

00:11:20.810 --> 00:11:23.100
Mark: Yeah, the other Rake games were just
terrible...

00:11:24.000 --> 00:11:27.710
Wade: Yeah it's a hard monster to incorporate. At least this was an open-world attempt at it I guess?

00:11:27.710 --> 00:11:32.150
Mark: Yeah... I mean-- but this game being not
developed isn't quite like you know

00:11:32.150 --> 00:11:34.990
Mark: P.T. being cancelled like...

00:11:34.990 --> 00:11:37.390
Wade: Yeah it's not that big of a loss but...

00:11:37.390 --> 00:11:39.110
Wade: It--It's still...

00:11:39.110 --> 00:11:42.200
Wade: I heard-- I've not played it, I heard the new
Resident Evil looks pretty promising though.

00:11:42.260 --> 00:11:46.070
Mark: Oh yeah, it looks really good. Like-- I-I
mean obviously when I played the demo

00:11:46.070 --> 00:11:48.710
Mark: they're trying to be P.T., that's what they
were going for.

00:11:48.710 --> 00:11:52.970
Mark: They were going for that hard-to-figure-out-what-the-hell-is-going-on style and

00:11:52.970 --> 00:11:57.800
Mark: you know they're obviously trying to
mimic that but you know i-it still had promise.

00:11:57.800 --> 00:12:01.420
Wade: The only bad thing I heard about it was
apparently they had some time lock stuff

00:12:01.430 --> 00:12:02.510
Wade: that angered people.

00:12:02.510 --> 00:12:03.530
Mark: Time lock?

00:12:03.530 --> 00:12:05.130
Wade: Yeah. Apparently there's like a...

00:12:05.130 --> 00:12:09.460
Wade: finger? There were some random objects you
couldn't use but then they time-locked some stuff

00:12:09.460 --> 00:12:11.760
Wade: just so that you have to wait till they
unlocked it to use it.

00:12:11.760 --> 00:12:13.050
Mark: Oh, that's stupid.

00:12:13.050 --> 00:12:15.740
Mark: I didn't even know about it unlocking later...

00:12:15.740 --> 00:12:18.420
Mark: I found another, uh, perch.

00:12:18.420 --> 00:12:21.200
Mark: Oohh, I'm almost back to camp... okay good.

00:12:21.200 --> 00:12:25.340
Wade: I keep finding waterfalls. I'm just gonna keep running in a straight line to see where I end up.

00:12:25.340 --> 00:12:27.000
Mark: Man, why do you keep finding waterfalls?

00:12:27.000 --> 00:12:29.100
Wade: 'Cause I'm probably wandering
around stupid...

00:12:29.100 --> 00:12:30.580
Mark: Probably.

00:12:31.500 --> 00:12:32.960
Mark: *sigh*

00:12:32.960 --> 00:12:33.460
*thudding noise*

00:12:33.460 --> 00:12:34.020
Mark: Whoa

00:12:34.020 --> 00:12:34.820
Wade: WHOA!!!!1!

00:12:34.820 --> 00:12:35.800
Wade: OH GOD!!

00:12:35.800 --> 00:12:36.300
Mark: *all the nope*

00:12:36.300 --> 00:12:37.300
Mark: What was that?

00:12:37.800 --> 00:12:39.500
Wade: It jumped out of a bush...

00:12:39.500 --> 00:12:40.140
Mark: Oh...

00:12:42.000 --> 00:12:43.000
Mark: Okay...

00:12:44.000 --> 00:12:45.000
Mark: You alright?

00:12:47.000 --> 00:12:47.790
Wade: *heart stopped* Yeah...

00:12:47.790 --> 00:12:50.800
Mark: Heh, man you're getting all the scares
and not me.

00:12:51.030 --> 00:12:53.890
Wade: I-- Yeah, I lead you to one scare and now I'm paying the price for it.

00:12:53.890 --> 00:12:54.780
Mark: *laughter at Wade's expense*

00:12:54.780 --> 00:12:56.660
Mark: It's karma baby, it's karma...

00:12:56.660 --> 00:13:00.060
Wade: It was at the house we got the traps-- the other side of that house, he popped out...

00:13:00.060 --> 00:13:02.560
Mark: Oh, ok... sure...

00:13:02.560 --> 00:13:05.560
Wade: Oh jeez Louis... I deserved that but god...

00:13:05.560 --> 00:13:09.440
Mark: *laughing* I'm gonna  check the cameras that I placed, let me see...

00:13:09.520 --> 00:13:14.760
Mark: *camera sounds* camera one, camera two...

00:13:15.700 --> 00:13:18.180
Mark: Huh... I see nothing!

00:13:18.180 --> 00:13:20.360
Mark: *beautiful singing* I see...

00:13:20.360 --> 00:13:22.740
Mark: fieeelds of black...

00:13:23.760 --> 00:13:29.240
Mark: Oh god-- I see you! *laughs* Holy shit. I saw you creeping up on one of the cameras.

00:13:30.900 --> 00:13:32.500
Mark: *second thoughts* Th-th-that was you right?

00:13:32.570 --> 00:13:34.740
Wade: Yeah th- that was-- *laughs* no, that was another random hunter.

00:13:34.740 --> 00:13:36.840
Mark: W-Wade, is that you?

00:13:36.840 --> 00:13:37.660
Mark: Ohgod...

00:13:37.660 --> 00:13:40.240
Mark: The scariest creature is man!

00:13:40.240 --> 00:13:43.340
Mark: You better have a good reason for 
me being out in these woods!

00:13:43.370 --> 00:13:46.759
Mark: I haven't seen no Rake 'round here...

00:13:46.759 --> 00:13:48.379
Mark: Oh, holy shit--

00:13:48.379 --> 00:13:49.979
Mark: Where the fuck did you come from?

00:13:49.980 --> 00:13:50.560
Wade: Hi!

00:13:51.700 --> 00:13:52.460
*door closes*

00:13:52.460 --> 00:13:54.340
Mark: Woah, I didn't know you could close that...

00:13:54.880 --> 00:13:56.820
