00:13:56.820 --> 00:13:57.680
Wade: I don't know--

00:13:57.680 --> 00:13:58.720
Wade: Oh-- he broke the camera up on the--

00:13:58.720 --> 00:13:59.280
Wade: He always--

00:13:59.280 --> 00:14:01.699
Wade: Okay, he loves to break this camera up on
this hill

00:14:01.699 --> 00:14:04.850
Mark: Oh alright, well I'm gonna put a camera up
there and then I'm gonna wait

00:14:04.850 --> 00:14:06.990
Mark: we're gonna wait for him...

00:14:06.990 --> 00:14:10.290
Mark: and when he
attacks you because he doesn't like you

00:14:10.960 --> 00:14:13.100
Mark: we're gonna get it--Aw, I was gonna do that.

00:14:13.100 --> 00:14:13.940
Mark: Alright.

00:14:13.940 --> 00:14:14.760
Mark: Where he at?

00:14:14.760 --> 00:14:16.480
Wade: Trap down? I'm going to put a bear trap down.

00:14:16.640 --> 00:14:17.140
Wade: Nope.

00:14:17.140 --> 00:14:17.640
Mark: Ah, fuck it--

00:14:17.640 --> 00:14:19.060
Mark: AAHH! WHAT THE FUCK!

00:14:19.060 --> 00:14:19.840
Mark:  HI!

00:14:19.840 --> 00:14:21.560
Mark: OW! Mah face!

00:14:22.040 --> 00:14:22.820
Mark: Ow...

00:14:22.820 --> 00:14:24.170
Wade: I gotta get some footage of this...

00:14:24.520 --> 00:14:25.960
Mark: what did you watch that?

00:14:25.960 --> 00:14:27.120
Wade: No, I was too late.

00:14:27.120 --> 00:14:28.100
Mark: Oh man...

00:14:28.100 --> 00:14:30.640
Mark: Well, I'll stay out here then...

00:14:30.640 --> 00:14:32.640
Mark: So you can get the good footage!

00:14:33.060 --> 00:14:34.300
Wade: And make sure I close the door...

00:14:34.300 --> 00:14:36.360
Mark: AH! I hit a bear trap...

00:14:36.360 --> 00:14:37.960
Mark:  I'm an idiot...

00:14:37.960 --> 00:14:39.440
Mark: I'm- it's dead by daylight all over again.

00:14:39.440 --> 00:14:40.490
Wade: This is just like that! Yeah, JUST like that--

00:14:40.490 --> 00:14:42.170
Wade: I- we placed those!

00:14:42.170 --> 00:14:46.700
Mark: Oh man... or maybe it didn't? I'm dying, I
need to get back and eat- get some health.

00:14:46.790 --> 00:14:49.970
Mark: Well... Okay, first aid

00:14:50.220 --> 00:14:51.220
*moist squish*

00:14:51.220 --> 00:14:54.139
Mark: *mouth fart* Oh, why was that so WET?

00:14:54.900 --> 00:14:56.980
Mark: Why was that so wet? ( ͡° ͜ʖ ͡°)

00:14:56.980 --> 00:14:57.889
Wade: I don't know...

00:14:59.540 --> 00:15:02.900
Wade: Oh. The door closing is kind of stirring when- -

00:15:02.900 --> 00:15:03.620
Mark: I know, yeah.

00:15:04.060 --> 00:15:05.240
Mark: When you're not ready for it.

00:15:05.240 --> 00:15:05.740
Wade: Yeah...

00:15:05.740 --> 00:15:08.020
Mark: You stay safe in the van.

00:15:08.029 --> 00:15:10.649
Mark: I'll be back by morning.

00:15:10.649 --> 00:15:11.789
Wade: I'm watching you.

00:15:11.980 --> 00:15:13.220
Mark: Are you?

00:15:13.220 --> 00:15:15.460
Mark: You'll let it know if it comes up behind me right?

00:15:15.460 --> 00:15:16.420
Wade: Yeah.

00:15:16.420 --> 00:15:17.000
Mark: Okay...

00:15:17.240 --> 00:15:20.760
Mark: *Mic explodes* AH FUCK! OKAY, AHHH! AAH! AAHH!

00:15:20.760 --> 00:15:22.000
Mark: Were you looking?!

00:15:22.000 --> 00:15:23.460
Wade: Yeah I saw that, it was great footage!

00:15:23.460 --> 00:15:25.580
Mark: Ok good! *laughs* I hope it was worth it!

00:15:25.580 --> 00:15:26.560
*Rake coming back for round 2*

00:15:26.560 --> 00:15:28.960
Mark: Oh, oh god... he hits- oh, where--

00:15:28.960 --> 00:15:30.620
Mark: He's running right towards the van!

00:15:30.880 --> 00:15:32.580
Wade: Alright, I'll pull out my rifle...

00:15:32.580 --> 00:15:35.260
Mark: AH! God dammit he got me again! *laughs*

00:15:35.260 --> 00:15:36.980
Mark: That sack of shit!

00:15:37.380 --> 00:15:39.800
Mark: Okay... Well he's hanging around now..

00:15:40.300 --> 00:15:41.140
Mark: Oh god- Not again!

00:15:41.140 --> 00:15:43.400
Mark: God dammit I'm stuck in a loop!

00:15:43.400 --> 00:15:45.220
Wade: I don't- I don't see him!

00:15:45.220 --> 00:15:46.380
Mark: Help!

00:15:46.920 --> 00:15:48.040
Wade: Oh that's him! *ignores Mark*

00:15:48.040 --> 00:15:49.150
Mark: Help!

00:15:49.150 --> 00:15:51.130
Mark: Oh geez, he's in camp...

00:15:51.130 --> 00:15:52.690
Mark:  Whoa, that's weird...

00:15:52.690 --> 00:15:53.460
Mark: Okay, I'm--

00:15:53.460 --> 00:15:54.100
Mark:  Ouhh--

00:15:54.100 --> 00:15:56.020
Mark: Okay, are we safe up here?

00:15:56.020 --> 00:15:57.340
Wade: I think so...

00:15:57.340 --> 00:15:57.900
Wade: AH!

00:15:57.900 --> 00:15:59.900
Mark: *more laughter at Wade's expense*

00:15:59.900 --> 00:16:03.000
Mark: Just seeing you get hit... that's really funny...

00:16:03.460 --> 00:16:04.120
Wade: *more regret*

00:16:04.340 --> 00:16:04.840
Mark: Okay.

00:16:04.840 --> 00:16:07.180
Wade: That's one of the ways to break the game, kind of, is to stand up there

00:16:07.180 --> 00:16:09.760
Wade: 'cause if you're up there, he just dances around.

00:16:09.760 --> 00:16:13.060
Mark: Okay. I'm gonna place bear traps
around the camp.

00:16:13.060 --> 00:16:13.940
Wade: That's a good idea.

00:16:13.940 --> 00:16:15.120
(that's not a good idea)

00:16:17.500 --> 00:16:18.800
Mark: I got a lot of 'em.

00:16:19.100 --> 00:16:20.100
Mark: Seems good...

00:16:20.110 --> 00:16:22.710
Wade: Well if he comes after us he's gonna regret it.

00:16:22.710 --> 00:16:25.410
Wade: And if we have to have run anywhere we're gonna regret it

00:16:25.410 --> 00:16:26.260
*Mark laughs*

00:16:26.260 --> 00:16:30.400
Mark: We got the back of the van, that'll probably
be good enough for our survival.

00:16:30.640 --> 00:16:32.320
Wade: Yeah. I'm trying, it's not working...

00:16:32.320 --> 00:16:36.600
Mark: ♫Come out, come out, wherever you are!♫

00:16:37.070 --> 00:16:40.000
Wade: ♫'Cause we're ready for huntin'♫

00:16:40.580 --> 00:16:44.500
Mark: ♫We're rednecks with a lot of guns!♫

00:16:44.780 --> 00:16:47.120
Wade: ♫Get my Moonshine♫

00:16:47.140 --> 00:16:48.000
Wade: YeAh

00:16:48.000 --> 00:16:49.260
*Mark laughs*

00:16:49.260 --> 00:16:50.640
Mark: Yeeah.

00:16:50.640 --> 00:16:54.640
Mark: You sound so unsure about your moonshine, you think that as a hillbilly you would've known-

00:16:54.640 --> 00:16:57.400
Mark: *revelation* You're not a real hillbilly are ya?

00:16:57.410 --> 00:17:00.110
Wade: *so sophisticated* No I am not, you have caught me in my lie.

00:17:00.110 --> 00:17:03.290
Mark: *hillbilly* W-W-What are you, 
some sort of fancy pants?

00:17:03.290 --> 00:17:06.280
Wade: *sophisticate* Yes that is- I'm from Fancy Pants, Rhode island.

00:17:06.280 --> 00:17:09.440
Mark: *hillbilly* Wow, that-- I didn't know that was
real town but considering I'm

00:17:09.440 --> 00:17:11.000
Mark: just a dumb hillbilly I believe you.

00:17:11.000 --> 00:17:13.900
Mark: Sorry, I fired off! *laughter*

00:17:13.900 --> 00:17:17.080
Mark: I hit control-- I didn't know control was shot

00:17:17.120 --> 00:17:19.260
Wade: *hillbilly* Don't mind me wettin' myself here!

00:17:19.260 --> 00:17:21.000
*Mark laughs*

00:17:21.180 --> 00:17:25.100
Wade: I'm devolving into a hillbilly, I think 
I'll *hillbilly speak* right there!

00:17:25.130 --> 00:17:27.650
Mark: *hillbilly* That's what happens when you nearly get shot.

00:17:27.650 --> 00:17:29.660
Wade: *hillbilly* It is, you devolve into hillbilly.

00:17:29.660 --> 00:17:32.720
Wade: 'Cause I think it's really good for me to be up here with a sniper rifle

00:17:32.720 --> 00:17:33.950
Wade: before he gets nice and close.

00:17:33.950 --> 00:17:36.130
Mark: Yeah... okay I'm watching.

00:17:36.130 --> 00:17:37.790
Mark:  Man this camera's shaky

00:17:37.790 --> 00:17:40.230
Mark: I'm gonna watch you get eaten.

00:17:40.230 --> 00:17:41.910
Mark: *hungry* I'm gonna watch you.

00:17:42.320 --> 00:17:43.580
Mark: I'm gonna watch when it happens.

00:17:44.700 --> 00:17:45.980
Mark: ...'cause it's so janky.

00:17:45.980 --> 00:17:48.060
Wade: See... Ah, oh I stepped on a- ah oh!

00:17:48.060 --> 00:17:48.700
*Mark laughs*

00:17:48.700 --> 00:17:52.540
Mark: You just went completely horizontal when you went on the ground!

00:17:52.550 --> 00:17:54.400
Mark: Uhhh... oh you died!

00:17:54.400 --> 00:17:56.200
Wade: I lost my sniper rifle ;__;

00:17:56.200 --> 00:17:58.200
Mark: Oh come on man!

00:17:58.310 --> 00:18:00.200
Mark: We probably needed that maybe...

00:18:00.200 --> 00:18:03.000
Mark: Probably everybody at home is getting sick...

00:18:03.000 --> 00:18:04.000
Wade: I went face first-

00:18:04.000 --> 00:18:07.680
Mark: Ah! I hit a god damn fucking bear trap!

00:18:07.680 --> 00:18:08.460
(told you it wasn't a good idea)

00:18:09.000 --> 00:18:12.760
Mark: Why are there so many bear traps around the camp?

00:18:12.760 --> 00:18:15.200
Wade: I'm face first into this one.

00:18:15.200 --> 00:18:16.280
Mark: Where are you?

00:18:16.280 --> 00:18:17.180
Wade: Up on the hill.

00:18:17.180 --> 00:18:17.900
Mark: Oh...

00:18:18.440 --> 00:18:20.900
Wade: The hill that has all the bear traps to get up too.

00:18:20.900 --> 00:18:23.440
Mark: Oh god I hit it again!

00:18:23.440 --> 00:18:24.140
*Wade laughs*

00:18:24.140 --> 00:18:27.140
Mark: Fuck- why is there an option to be The
Rake?

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:30.180
Wade: I wish we cou- oh you died too?!

00:18:30.180 --> 00:18:31.010
Mark: Uh, yeah...

00:18:31.010 --> 00:18:33.890
Mark: Oh my god, my corpse is face first
and--

00:18:33.890 --> 00:18:35.660
Mark: AH! I hit another one!

00:18:35.680 --> 00:18:36.780
Mark: God dammit...

00:18:36.780 --> 00:18:38.160
Wade: Stop running into them!

00:18:38.160 --> 00:18:38.840
Mark: I'M NOT!

00:18:38.840 --> 00:18:41.360
Mark: I'm so fa- oh there's- oh, did you hit one?

00:18:41.360 --> 00:18:41.980
*silence*

00:18:41.980 --> 00:18:42.660
Wade: No...? ._.

00:18:42.660 --> 00:18:43.899
Mark: Oh, did IT hit one?

00:18:44.760 --> 00:18:46.000
Wade: It must've.

00:18:46.320 --> 00:18:48.460
Mark: Well, we don't have a shotgun or a sniper rifle so we ju-

00:18:48.460 --> 00:18:50.350
Wade: We need to find the house that has the other gun!

00:18:50.350 --> 00:18:52.770
Mark: We have to beat it to death with our fists.

00:18:53.000 --> 00:18:55.260
Mark: Oh, here's another corpse!

00:18:56.300 --> 00:18:56.800
Mark: Well...

00:18:56.800 --> 00:19:00.399
Wade: Oh hey, I moved! I'm no longer in the bear trap. The Rake must've... come by...

00:19:00.420 --> 00:19:01.400
Mark: Oh my god.

00:19:01.720 --> 00:19:02.800
Mark: It's here.

00:19:02.800 --> 00:19:04.299
Mark: *bear trap fail* krrrrrshAAAAAGHH

00:19:04.299 --> 00:19:07.119
Wade: Woah, hello! You just rained in from the sky.

00:19:07.120 --> 00:19:08.539
Mark: Oh, there's so many bear traps...

00:19:08.539 --> 00:19:09.159
Wade: WOW!

00:19:09.420 --> 00:19:11.380
Mark: How many corpses can we leave?

00:19:11.380 --> 00:19:14.240
Wade: Watch whenever we die. Watch the spawn, like-- okay.

00:19:14.240 --> 00:19:15.609
Wade: So you stare at this point

00:19:15.609 --> 00:19:16.119
right here

00:19:16.119 --> 00:19:17.000
Mark: Alright, ready.

00:19:20.500 --> 00:19:21.180
Wade: Wee!

00:19:21.180 --> 00:19:22.660
*Mark laughing*

00:19:22.660 --> 00:19:25.040
Mark: You like...  zoom in...

00:19:25.040 --> 00:19:27.440
Mark: You zoom in from who knows where...

00:19:27.900 --> 00:19:29.880
Mark:  Oh, there's so many corpses.

00:19:29.889 --> 00:19:32.109
Mark: Alright, so I guess we're done here. We
kind of broke the game.

00:19:32.109 --> 00:19:34.649
Mark: We got a giant pile of corpses here, um,

00:19:35.220 --> 00:19:36.460
Mark: of assorted people...

00:19:36.460 --> 00:19:37.629
Mark: They actually-- it's weird, they don't actually

00:19:37.629 --> 00:19:39.709
Mark: look like us, these-these dead bodies.

00:19:39.709 --> 00:19:41.789
Mark:They're-- we're wearing like yellow ban-

00:19:41.789 --> 00:19:44.689
Mark: AH! Fucking, bear trap...

00:19:45.500 --> 00:19:47.600
Mark: Anyway, we're all done here. Hope you enjoyed this--

00:19:47.600 --> 00:19:49.620
Mark: Um, we can't figure out other ways to play
this game,

00:19:49.620 --> 00:19:51.280
Mark: because The Rake doesn't want to play nicely.

00:19:51.280 --> 00:19:53.280
Mark: So, thank you everybody so
much for watching,

00:19:53.280 --> 00:19:55.020
Mark: thank you Wade for joining me on this one.

00:19:55.029 --> 00:19:55.840
Wade: My pleasure.

00:19:55.840 --> 00:19:57.840
Mark: Check out Wade's channel in the description below.

00:19:58.300 --> 00:19:59.340
Mark: And as always,

00:19:59.340 --> 00:20:02.000
